{
	"$schema": "https://github.com/ConductionNL/nextcloud-vue/raw/main/src/schemas/app-manifest-v2.schema.json",
	"_note": "The Registers page (openspec/changes/simple-structure-profile, REQ-SSP-006). One counted tile per register, each opening the list that register already has. The simple structure's `Registers` menu entry opens it; the full structure nests the same lists under `Registers` and does not need it, but the page is routable in both, because a profile never adds or removes a page. No menu entry is declared here: src/menu-layout.simple.json gives the manifest's own `Registers` entry this page as its route. Every count is a plain count of one schema with no filter, the only kind OpenRegister's aggregation endpoint is certain to evaluate (see the note on DecisionsReport).",
